{"4925470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wildegrove", "steam_appid": 4925470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4959550], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of Wildegrove rests in the hands of its smallest guardian.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set within a dark, vibrant, and mystical ancient forest, <strong>Wildegrove</strong> is a high-octane isometric bullet hell roguelike. Play as <strong>The Keeper</strong>, a tiny but fierce gnome chosen as the mortal avatar of the Moon Goddess, Selune. Command the raw power of lunar magic, manage your mana to unleash devastating spells, and stand defiant against the relentless undead legions of <i><strong>Nytherius</strong></i>, the God of Decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you cleanse the corruption, or will the grove wither away forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness the Power of the Moon:</strong> Cast powerful, screen-clearing spells by mastering your mana pool. Adapt your magical arsenal on the fly to survive dense, chaotic bullet hell waves of Nytherius's undead horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/282fad751f7a966803bdb39b62f17357.poster.avif?t=1785824430\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/282fad751f7a966803bdb39b62f17357.webm?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/282fad751f7a966803bdb39b62f17357.mp4?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark, Vibrant, and Mystical World:</strong> Explore the hauntingly beautiful depths of Wildegrove, a forest where glowing, vibrant colors contrast with eerie, dark corruption and ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/9ab2f599e52164c391126184785460b3.poster.avif?t=1785824430\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/9ab2f599e52164c391126184785460b3.webm?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/9ab2f599e52164c391126184785460b3.mp4?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empower with Ancient Runes:</strong> Gather energy from fallen foes during intense combat waves. Spend your resources between waves to acquire ancient runes, customizing your build and turning Keeper into an unstoppable force of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/7769dc24ca0839e0f5cdd015c130b79a.poster.avif?t=1785824430\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/7769dc24ca0839e0f5cdd015c130b79a.webm?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/7769dc24ca0839e0f5cdd015c130b79a.mp4?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast Precise Combo Spells:</strong> Execute precise combos to unleash the strongest spells in your arsenal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/1287ea01564bbbf6817d70f2db5dd345.poster.avif?t=1785824430\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/1287ea01564bbbf6817d70f2db5dd345.webm?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925470/extras/1287ea01564bbbf6817d70f2db5dd345.mp4?t=1785824430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tiny Light Against Absolute Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the rot of Nytherius seeps into every root and branch, Selune’s blessing is your only shield. Can a tiny gnome bring a god of decay to his knees? Answer the call of the forest, ready your spells, and purge the corruption in Wildegrove!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of Wildegrove rests in the hands of its smallest guardian.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set within a dark, vibrant, and mystical ancient forest, <strong>Wildegrove</strong> is a high-octane isometric bullet hell roguelike. Play as <strong>The Keeper</strong>, a tiny but fierce gnome chosen as the mortal avatar of the Moon Goddess, Selune. Command the raw power of lunar magic, manage your mana to unleash devastating spells, and stand defiant against the relentless undead legions of <i><strong>Nytherius</strong></i>, the God of Decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you cleanse the corruption, or will the grove wither away forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness the Power of the Moon:</strong> Cast powerful, screen-clearing spells by mastering your mana pool. Adapt your magical arsenal on the fly to survive den